{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15643","headline":"和李员外与舍人咏玫瑰花寄徐侍郎 · 司空曙","name":"和李员外与舍人咏玫瑰花寄徐侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙吏紫薇郎，奇花共翫芳。\n攒星排绿蒂，照眼发红光。\n暗妬翻堦药，遥连直署香。\n游枝蜂绕易，碍刺鸟衔妨。\n露湿凝衣粉，风吹散蕊黄。\n蒙茏珠树合，焕烂锦屏张。\n留客胜看竹，思人比爱棠。\n如传采苹咏，远思满潇湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}